  "body": "Our vendors are committed to selling this one of a kind 1940s residence which has been masterfully reimagined through an extensive rebuild, creating a home of exceptional quality, timeless elegance and contemporary sophistication.\r\nCommanding sweeping panoramic views across Devonport to Rangitoto Island, the home embraces its spectacular setting at every opportunity. Bathed in natural light, beautifully proportioned interiors and expansive glazing create a seamless connection between refined living spaces and the ever-changing coastal landscape beyond.\r\nDesigned for both grand-scale entertaining and relaxed family living, the heart of the home is in a voluminous room with an exquisite bespoke kitchen that anchors the open-plan dining and family room. Crafted with uncompromising attention to detail and premium finishes, this welcoming space flows effortlessly onto sun-soaked private terraces, where sheltered outdoor living and breathtaking vistas provide the perfect backdrop for every occasion. A separate lounge, complete with a feature gas fireplace, offers an elegant retreat for quieter moments.\r\nArranged over multiple levels, the generous floor plan provides exceptional flexibility for modern family life. Five beautifully appointed bedrooms, a study and four luxurious bathrooms include a fully self-contained studio - ideal for extended family, guests, independent teenagers or a sophisticated work-from-home area with its own entrance.  A media room for movie nights at home and there is an internal-access garage. \r\nBehind its classic contemporary façade lies every modern convenience expected of a home of this calibre. Ducted central heating and cooling, double glazing throughout ensures year-round comfort, while the comprehensive rebuild delivers the confidence and performance of a near-new residence.\r\nFew locations rival the enduring appeal of Devonport with its boutique shopping, acclaimed cafés and restaurants, outstanding schools, picturesque beaches, parks, the golf course, cinema, supermarket, library and the ferry are all within easy walking distance, placing Auckland's CBD just a short and scenic ferry ride away. \r\nA home of rare distinction, where heritage character has been flawlessly paired with contemporary luxury, this is an exceptional opportunity to secure one of Mt Victoria's finest family residences in one of Auckland's most beloved communities.\r\nYou can move in here and not have to do a thing as all the hard work has been done for you. \r\nI look forward to seeing you at the open home, or phone for an appointment to view.",
